      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I love this idea, most of Vrchat's main problem nowadays when it comes to meeting new people is that every public is just packed full off the Annoying type of trollers at all times. Trolling CAN be funny, when done correctly, but sometimes its just genuinely hurtful towards people. and those people are never usually above user rank.",
